        Root cause:
        The bug arises from the lack of proper synchronization when executing non-blocking modesets in parallel, which can lead to corruption of global registers and other shared resources due to concurrent access without locking mechanisms. This can result in unpredictable behavior and system instability.

        Commit message:
        drm/i915: Put all non-blocking modesets onto an ordered wq
